Distance: 1300m Conditions: Conditions were consistent throughout racing. Mostly calm water with occasional minor crosswind/cross headwind. Light rain. Comments: Race Order:
B3, G3, G5, B2, B1, G1, B4, G2, G4
The boys 2V event had to be stopped after the first 10&#45;12 strokes due to a significant turn toward shore from the Hopkins crew, that was not due to breakage. The crews were brought back to the line and the race restarted without incident. 
Thank you to Hopkins and Dexter&#45;Southfield for joining us!
